Tatoeba
-------
Tatoeba sentence exports (https://tatoeba.org/, CC BY 2.0 FR) are consulted at
build time as style references only. No Tatoeba sentence text — verbatim or
adapted — ships in the app or the curriculum database, so no per-sentence
attribution applies. Should that ever change, per-sentence attribution as
required by CC BY 2.0 FR must be added here and in the app.

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/
